{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 2,
  "title": "Passage 2",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s02-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p01.mp3",
      "en": "One day, I picked up my daughter Lingling from school and went to the supermarket for a few things.",
      "cn": "一天，我从学校接上我的女儿玲玲，然后去超市买些东西。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s02-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p02.mp3",
      "en": "I was hoping to be in and out quickly.",
      "cn": "我想着进去之后很快就能出来。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s02-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p03.mp3",
      "en": "I found a short line with just one person in front of me.",
      "cn": "我发现有一条很短的队，只有一个人排在我前面。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s02-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p04.mp3",
      "en": "It was an old woman, and she was paying for her things with only coins.",
      "cn": "那是一位老妇人，她只用硬币在付钱。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s02-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p05.mp3",
      "en": "After a long day at work, I thought the woman was very terrible.",
      "cn": "在漫长的一天工作后，我觉得这位老妇人真是太麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s02-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p06.mp3",
      "en": "But then I saw a young salesman.",
      "cn": "但就在这时，我看到一位年轻的售货员。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s02-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p07.mp3",
      "en": "He helped her count her coins, ever so kindly taking them from her shaking hands.",
      "cn": "他帮她数硬币，十分友好地从老妇人颤抖的手中接过硬币。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s02-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p08.mp3",
      "en": "He repeatedly said and nodded: \"Yes, ma'am.\"",
      "cn": "他连连点头并反复地说着：“对的，女士。”"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s02-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p09.mp3",
      "en": "When she asked if she had enough money to buy a bag, he told her she did.",
      "cn": "当老妇人询问她的钱是否足够买一个袋子时，售货员告诉她可以。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s02-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p10.mp3",
      "en": "Then he walked over two lines and got one for her.",
      "cn": "然后，他穿过两列队伍，给她拿来一个袋子。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s02-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p11.mp3",
      "en": "This salesman wasn't angry at all.",
      "cn": "这位售货员完全不生气。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s02-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p12.mp3",
      "en": "He was patient and kind.",
      "cn": "他很耐心，也很友好。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s02-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p13.mp3",
      "en": "As I was watching him, I saw Lingling was too.",
      "cn": "当我观察他时，我发现玲玲也在看他。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s02-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p14.mp3",
      "en": "I realised my daughter was learning an important lesson from a stranger.",
      "cn": "我意识到我的女儿正从一个陌生人身上学习重要的一课。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s02-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p15.mp3",
      "en": "When the woman was finished, the salesman began ringing up my things and thanked me for my patience.",
      "cn": "老妇人结完账后，售货员开始帮我结账，并感谢我耐心等候。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s02-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p16.mp3",
      "en": "I thanked him too.",
      "cn": "我也向他表示了感谢。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 17,
      "chunkId": "s02-p17",
      "image": "assets/images/17.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p17.mp3",
      "en": "I found the manager and told him about the salesman's kindness and patience.",
      "cn": "我找到经理，向他讲述了这位售货员的善良和耐心。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 18,
      "chunkId": "s02-p18-01",
      "image": "assets/images/18.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-01.mp3",
      "en": "Then we left the supermarket with a full basket,",
      "cn": "然后，我们带着装得满满的购物篮离开了超市，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 19,
      "sourceSentenceId": 18,
      "chunkId": "s02-p18-02",
      "image": "assets/images/18.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s02-p18-02.mp3",
      "en": "but also with a heart full of thankfulness for such an important lesson.",
      "cn": "也因学到了如此重要的一课而满怀感激。"
    }
  ],
